# The container build (src/server/wellfed-server/packaging/Containerfile)
# copies only the workspace's sources: never builds, private evidence or
# agent checkouts.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/
!src/
src/web/
src/app/
# The app's bridge crate is a workspace member: cargo loads its manifest.
!src/app/rust/
src/fuzz/
**/node_modules/
**/target/
